{{ArcaneBox}}
'''Arcane Persistence''' is an [[Arcane Enhancement]] for [[Warframes]] that restricts damage taken while {{Stat|Armor}} is at least '''700''', at the cost of losing all {{Stat|Shield|Shields}} .

