==Acquisition==
*Can be bought from [[Roathe]] at [[La Cathédrale]] in the [[Sanctum Anatomica]] for 5 {{Resource|Maphica}}.
*May appear as a [[Steel Path]] [[The Descendia]] reward on a weekly rotational basis.
**Infernum 6 and 13 awards 1.
**Infernum 20 awards 3.

==Notes==
*Arcane Persistence's effects can be lost if the user's {{Stat|Armor}} is reduced below 700, such as from {{D|Corrosive}} or {{D|Heat}} status effects.
**To fully withstand {{D|Corrosive}}(-26%), a minimum of only 946 {{Stat|Armor}} is needed.
**To fully withstand {{D|Heat}}(-50%), a minimum of 1400 {{Stat|Armor}} is needed.
**With both status effects together(-63%), a minimum of 1892 {{Stat|Armor}} is needed.
*Arcane Persistence is disabled if the user receives a {{D|Magnetic}} status effect or is within an ability nullification field such as {{E|Nullifier Crewman|Nullifiers}}.
*Despite the phrasing, the arcane will function with exactly 700 {{Stat|Armor}}.
*Does not work on self-inflicted sources of damage;
**{{WF|Garuda}}'s {{A|Bloodletting}} will not reduce the health drain. 
*Changes [[Hijack]]'s [[Shield]] drain to [[Health]] drain.
*This Arcane is detrimental for [[Archwing|Archwings]] , since no Archwing can reach the minimum treshold of 700{{Stat|Armor}} ,it will deprave the player of his shields without granting any benefits , leaving him vulnerable.
  <!-- (outside of using {{Resource|Azure Archon Shard}}s) --> 

==Tips==
*{{M|Health Conversion}} allows any Warframe to meet the 700 {{Stat|Armor}} condition.
*4x {{Resource|Azure Archon Shard}} grants +600 {{Stat|Armor}}. 3x {{Resource|Azure Archon Shard|Tauforged Azure Archon Shard}} grants +675 {{Stat|Armor}}.
*{{Arcane|Arcane Grace}} requires 8334 {{Stat|Health}} to reach 500 Health/second. This assumes 100% uptime on Grace which is unrealistic, so more health to give the arcane a chance to trigger is advised.
*{{WF|Inaros}} can easily keep {{Arcane|Arcane Persistence}} active by healing with {{A|Sandstorm}}, and gaining enough {{Stat|Armor}} and [[Status Immunity]] with {{A|Scarab Shell}}.
*{{WF|Nidus}} also greatly benefit from {{Arcane|Arcane Persistence}} especially when combined with {{M|Parasitic Vitality}} .
**With {{A|Ravenous}} he can easily outheal the maximum of 500 damage/sec all while being protected from negative status effects .
**{{A|Parasitic Link}} when casted on an ennemy , will redirect all negatives status effects towards the target , offering {{WF|Nidus}} another way to protect himself from a potential {{Arcane|Arcane Persistence}} deactivation .

==Bugs==
*Works with {{D|Overguard}} from any source, but only caps the damage of the first hit every '''1''' second to 500.
**This makes it unviable to utilize as a survival tool for frames that rely mostly on their shields or overguard to stay alive, such as {{WF|Styanax}} with his [[Intrepid Stand]] augment.
*Works with {{M|Quick Thinking}} and {{M|Gladiator Finesse}}, but only caps the damage of each hit to 500, not the damage per second.
